{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "_data": []}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n2le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe7n2le01ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"id": 0, "image": "enpe7n2le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Camila</span>: Hi, what did you do yesterday?</br><span class=\"strong\">Ruben</span>: Hi! I wrote a report about language semantics, but I didn't complete it. I need some help with that task now because that topic is very complex. Can you help me in this moment?</br><span class=\"strong\">Camila</span>: Oh! Darling I'm looking for a new laptop that I need for my job, hum, but what do you need?</br><span class=\"strong\">Ruben</span>: Well, some specific information about Language Semantics.</br><span class=\"strong\">Camila</span>: Ok, we know that semantics is the field concerned with mathematical structure and the meaning of programming languages. It evaluates the meaning of strings syntactically defined in the specific programming language, depending on the needs of the users.", "time": "100"}, {"id": 1, "image": "enpe7n2le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ruben</span>: I see, and do you have more information about it?</br><span class=\"strong\">Camila</span>: Remember, in the past, we used the definition of semantics for linguistics only, nowadays, semantics is an important part of computer science.</br><span class=\"strong\">Ruben</span>: You are right, semantics does the processes of a computer, I mean, it executes a program in a specific language.</br><span class=\"strong\">Camila</span>: Correct! At the beginning, programming languages were not able to solve complex problems. With its evolution, nowadays, they are successful, as they model some essential aspects of how to construct complex programs.", "time": "50500"}, {"id": 2, "image": "enpe7n2le01ob09re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ruben</span>: So, is there any technique to understand semantics more easily?</br><span class=\"strong\">Camila</span>: Not at all. You have to study this topic more deeply to understand better. For example, there are four widely-used approaches to language semantics. These are: operational, axiomatic, denotational and logical semantics. However, many programmers dedicate their time to extend the language for programming at the operational level since they can execute those languages on a computer. Is it clear for you?</br><span class=\"strong\">Ruben</span>: I think so. Well, let me take some notes first, and then we go to buy your stuff.", "time": "94500"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can understand the concept of language semantics. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can exchange information about language semantics. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can identify key features related to language semantics.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How does a program execute in a computer?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Which programming languages do you know?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Understanding the World of Language Semantics", "type": "free_type_text_area"}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "STI", "question